# Registrations & finance tranche (P5-E — optional)

Minimal legacy port: seat capacity, public registration throttle, paid-tour open gate, tour-created finance outbox hook.

**Not full Tour Ops registration module.**

**Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p5/p5-e-registrations-finance.md`](../../TEMP/p5/p5-e-registrations-finance.md)

---

## Legacy anchors (reference only)

| Capability | Legacy path |
|------------|-------------|
| Seat capacity | `RegistrationCapacityService` |
| Public throttle | `public-registration-throttle.ts` |
| Paid tour OPEN | lifecycle + commerce gate |
| Tour-created finance | finance outbox on `TourCreated` |

Gap doc: [`legacy-vs-denali-gap-analysis.md`](../../apps/api/docs/legacy-vs-denali-gap-analysis.md) § Rate limits · registration capacity.

**Must not break:** PC-06 receipt flow · PC-07 Denali `offline_receipt` frozen default.

---

## Registration seat capacity (frozen — P5-E-N-002 REG-01..02)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/registrations/registration-capacity.service.ts`

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| REG-01 | `resolveRegistrationCapacityDecision` confirms when `acceptedSeats + partySize ≤ tourCapacity` |
| REG-01b | Unlimited capacity when `tourCapacity === null` |
| REG-02 | When full + policy `waitlist` → status `waitlist` (not hard reject) |
| REG-02b | When full + policy `open` → `RegistrationCapacityExceededError` (409) |

Wired in: `apps/api/src/urban/urban-registration.service.ts`

Spec: `apps/api/test/registration-capacity.spec.ts`

---

## Public registration throttle (frozen — P5-E-N-003 REG-03)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/registrations/public-registration-throttle.ts`

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| REG-03 | `POST /urban/registrations` calls `assertPublicRegistrationThrottle(clientIp)` before handler |
| REG-03b | Default 10 requests / 60s per IP (override `PUBLIC_REGISTRATION_THROTTLE_PER_MIN`) |
| REG-03c | Exceeded → HTTP 429 `PUBLIC_REGISTRATION_THROTTLE_EXCEEDED` |

Spec: covered in `apps/api/test/registration-capacity.spec.ts` (throttle band).

