## Paid tour OPEN gate (frozen — P5-E-N-004 FIN-01)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/registrations/assert-paid-tour-open-gate.ts`

Wired in: `apps/api/src/canonical/canonical-tour.service.ts` (publish transition) · invoked from `apps/api/src/tours/tours.service.ts` `updateTour`

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| FIN-01 | On `detectTourPublishTransition → published`, `assertPaidTourOpenCommerceGate` runs before persist |
| FIN-01a | `offline_receipt` tenant commerce allows publish PATCH to complete |
| FIN-01b | Gateway commerce blocked until `P5_D_GATEWAY_ACTIVATION_ENABLED=true` (403 `PAID_TOUR_OPEN_GATE_BLOCKED`) |

Spec: `apps/api/test/paid-tour-open-gate.spec.ts`

