## Tour-created finance outbox (frozen — P5-E-N-005 FIN-02)

Implementation (Phase 1.13): capability registry + HostIo —
`process-workspace-finance-outbox.ts` → `resolveWorkspaceFinanceEventReaction` →
workspace `eventReaction` adapter (`DenaliTourCreatedFinanceReactionAdapter`).
Denali ledger runner: `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/finance/api-tour-created-adapter`
(`runTourCreatedFinanceSideEffect(row, deps)`). No apps/api Denali boot registrar.

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| FIN-02 | `runTourCreatedFinanceSideEffect` processes `TourCreated` rows with `registrationId` + `paidAmountMinor` |
| FIN-02b | Idempotent claim via `tryClaimWorkspaceFinanceProcessedEvent` — replay returns `false` |

Spec: `apps/api/test/tour-created-finance-side-effect.spec.ts` · integration: `denali-finance-outbox.integration.spec.ts`

